 {'file':'upscaled_e62c660d-8173-4fa8-bad1-7ed47bf26056.webp','label':'Arched case crowns and central upholstered bench','height_m':5.1,'range_m':[4.3,5.9],'basis':'Rear case floor-to-crown approximately 390 px in a 2048 px-wide view; center bench seat-to-floor about 35–40 px. Assume a 0.45–0.50 m seat height; perspective and interpretation of the upholstery edge dominate uncertainty.'},
